{
  "slug": "toggl",
  "name": "Toggl",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Toggl Track integration for Claude Code. Log time entries by project and task, query what you tracked today or this week, and get aggregated summaries — all via natural language. Supports workspaces that require both project and task on every entry.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `toggl` (Use this skill when the user mentions Toggl, time tracking, logging hours, logging time, tracking work, \"how much…) and **1 MCP server**, `toggl`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install toggl@claude-community` from `run-as-root/toggl-claude-plugin`.",
